Author: LiamTrader43

Version: # Plugin version
    Major: 0
    Minor: 1
    Revision: 0

Targets: # Low TitleId of games which are compatibles with this plugin (0 for all)

Title: 3DS Achievements

Summary: Achievement pop-ups for 3DS games

Description: |
  Watches game memory and unlocks achievements defined in
  /achievements/<TitleID>.txt on the SD card. Unlocks are saved to
  /achievements/<TitleID>_unlocked.txt.

Compatibility: Any

MemorySize: 5MiB

UsePrivateMemory: false
